  message: "Satisfied in PR #1704 (dev 12a9ece5c9). odin.py's call_expression branch stands down when its parent is a member_expression; the member branch emits the one module.func edge. Behavioral evidence (test_odin.py::TestOdinMemberCallEmitsOneEdge): on dev before the fix, main :: proc { fmt.println(\"hi\") } produced ['odin:external:0-0:fmt.println:unresolved', 'odin:external:0-0:println:unresolved']; after, the first only. A plain call to an unknown procedure still yields its unresolved edge, and a plain call to a defined procedure still resolves."  # 0126
